 lines=['# MILESTONE 08 — GEDANGAN TRAFFIC DIGITAL TWIN','## 1. Executive summary',LABEL,f'\nTechnical engine: **{technical}**. {len(rr)} actual non-reproduction runs; {status["fresh_reproduction_runs"]} independent reproduction. Four operational interventions tested on existing model topology. No intervention is established as the best real-world Gedangan solution.','\n**INFRASTRUCTURE ENGINEERING FEASIBILITY: NOT VERIFIED — SURVEY AND DESIGN REQUIRED.**','\n**POLICY RECOMMENDATION: NOT YET DEFENSIBLE.** M06 empirical baseline is still blocked. M09 has not started.','## 2. Technical acceptance status',table(['Gate','Status'],status.items()),'## 3. M07 browser QA closure',f'{closure["status"]}. All15 years, LOW/REFERENCE/HIGH, custom edit/save, actual job/cache endpoint, comparison, recorded playback, NOT RUN, desktop1920×1080/mobile390×844 and console inspected. M07-UI-01 remains: Comparison on mobile has22px horizontal overflow. This was corrected in the QA record, not concealed. Original M07 source/reports/results were not edited. QA-specific custom copies/job ledger live under M08. See `documentation/m08/M07_BROWSER_QA_CLOSURE.md`.','## 4. Scenario catalog',table(['ID','Scenario','Catalog status','Actual results'],[(s,read(s)['name'],read(s)['status'],len([r for r in rr if r['solution_id']==s])) for s in [f'S{i:02d}' for i in range(8)]]),'## 5. Scenario design methodology','Schema/versioned JSON; bounded sequential execution. S01 training uses only2026 REFERENCE seed11, green grid8/12/16s, yellow3s/all-red2s. Holdout evaluation seeds42/43 were not used to choose timing. Objective: departed-cohort waiting +2100s per unserved request + worst-OD mean waiting×OD count. This is a transparent software experiment objective, not calibrated social cost. No combined-intervention additivity assumed.','## 6. Baseline setup','M051 Pilot Provisional is primary; M051 Strict tested separately where compatible. Corrected Provisional is selectable for S00/S02/S03/S04; S01 requires existing road controller. M04 types/OD and M07 projections reused. Step0.5s; demand0–1800s; fixed horizon0–2100s; warm-up0s; optional drain0s. Same railway settings and train schedule70/970s for primary comparisons. No one-sided longer drain, teleport rescue, vClass ignoring, permission expansion, new road connections or demand deletion.','## 7. Operational intervention models',table(['Scenario','Declared mechanism','Limits'],[('S01','One protected link per phase; chosen green8s; original phase order, yellow3s/all-red2s','Synthetic controller, not verified actual APILL'),('S02','Restrict one existing feeder-to-main left-turn movement; reroute on existing legal graph','No U-turn/new connectivity; failures retained'),('S03','Restrict one existing frontage exit movement','Existing frontage stays separate; local/feeder harm reported'),('S04','Defer four truck/trailer categories originally departing before900s by900s','Original ID/OD/type demand retained; deferral costs explicit'),('S05','No runnable coordination scenario','One valid road controller; railway crossing is not a second road controller')]),'## 8. Flyover conceptual feasibility','S06 CONCEPT_ONLY / NOT_SIMULATION_READY. Main arterial near existing Gedangan signal group is only a reference area, not a designed alignment. No ramp, elevated edge, false clearance or performance result created. Illustrative +6m/4%=150m each ramp; two ramps300m excluding vertical curves, landings, deck depth, frontage/feeder access and clearances. Footprint area and ROW fit unknown.','## 9. Underpass conceptual feasibility','S07 held to the same18-check gate. Illustrative −6m/4%=150m each ramp has the same exclusions and is not surveyed terrain/design. Groundwater, flooding, drainage/pump needs, utilities, foundation, railway construction staging, cost and land remain unknown. No cheaper/easier/better claim. Both concepts keep traffic metrics NULL and Run disabled.','## 10. Network lineage and derivative audit','Parent→scenario hashes and full declared changes are in each derivative `manifest.json`, linked from each `m08-input.json`. S00/S04 are byte copies. Operational geometry, lane lengths/speeds/shapes, junctions, connection identities, source edge lineage and railway crossing connections stay identical. S02/S03 narrow only declared movement permission; internal connector permissions are intersected with remaining legal incoming movements. No access expansion.','NETCONVERT1.28.0 unexpectedly recomputed/merged internal geometry during a timing-only roundtrip. Its intermediate XML and drift audit are retained and never used as final network. The final XML starts from the parent and receives only the verified semantic timing/permission delta. Actual SUMO validates/runs the final XML. This approach avoids quietly accepting NETCONVERT geometry drift.','Permission-graph component diagnostics (external edges; lane/via/connection permissions, not physical vehicle eligibility):', table(['Scenario','Family','vClass','Movements before','Movements after','Weak components before/after','Strong components before/after'],[(v['scenario'],v['family'],cls,m['before']['permitted_movements'],m['after']['permitted_movements'],str(m['before']['weak_components'])+'/'+str(m['after']['weak_components']),str(m['before']['strong_components'])+'/'+str(m['after']['strong_components'])) for v in optional('topology-audits.json',[]) for cls,m in v['classes'].items() if cls in ['passenger','truck']]), '## 11. Demand cohort parity','Frozen original cohort includes every request ID, OD/endpoints, type and original departure. Hashes and full JSON must match before comparison. Manifest explains network hash differences; unexpected topology, parent, cohort, year, seed, family, projection, rail or schedule changes are rejected. Only S04 is allowed to change effective departures, with a per-ID deferral ledger. All comparison guards below passed.' if all(c['parity']['comparable'] for c in comparisons) else 'Some comparisons rejected; inspect comparisons.json.',table(['Year','Seed','Solution','Requests retained','Legal routes changed','New routing failures','Became routable'],[(v['year'],v['seed'],v['solution'],v['requested'],v['rerouted_legal_count'],v['new_failed_count'],v['became_routable_count']) for v in optional('rerouting-audits.json',[]) if v['solution'] in ['S02','S03'] and v['growth']=='REFERENCE' and v['family']=='pilot-provisional']), 'Changed routes retain original OD/type/endpoints. Full per-ID route sequences and failure reasons remain in both actual route ledgers. No illegal shortcut or invented connection is accepted.', '## 12. Actual SUMO simulation matrix',table(['Year','Growth','Family','Seed','Scenario','Run ID','Requested','Arrived','Running','Failed'],[(r['year'],r['growth_scenario'],r['network_variant'],r['seed'],r['solution_id'],r['run_id'],r['requested'],r['arrived'],r['running_at_end'],r['failed_routes']) for r in sorted(rr,key=lambda r:(r['year'],r['growth_scenario'],r['network_variant'],r['seed'],r['solution_id']))]),'All configured2026–2040 years and existing custom M07 growth scenarios are supported; unexecuted combinations remain NOT RUN. Training rows seed11 are excluded from holdout Pareto/comparison.','## 13. Before/after comparison — 2026 and2040',table(['Year','Seed','Scenario','Requested','Routable','Failed','Loaded','Departed','Arrived','Running','Not departed','Unserved'],[(r['year'],r['seed'],r['solution_id'],r['requested'],r['routable'],r['failed_routes'],r['loaded'],r['departed'],r['arrived'],r['running_at_end'],r['not_departed'],r['unserved_total_at_horizon']) for r in primary if r['year'] in [2026,2040]]),table(['Year','Seed','Intervention','Δarrived','Δunserved','Δmax stopped','Δmax extent m'],[(c['year'],c['seed'],c['solution_id'],c['deltas']['arrived'],c['deltas']['unserved_total_at_horizon'],c['deltas']['max_stopped_count'],c['deltas']['max_lane_queue_extent_m']) for c in comparisons if c['year'] in [2026,2040] and c['growth']=='REFERENCE' and next(r for r in rr if r['run_id']==c['intervention'])['network_variant']=='pilot-provisional']), 'S01 effects vary across seeds and years. Closing the frontage exit can worsen arrivals and unfinished demand; these losses remain visible. Freight deferral is charged explicitly and does not remove truck requests. No overall winner follows from these conditional changes.', '## 14. Travel time results',table(['Year','Seed','Scenario','Waiting mean s','Elapsed trip duration mean s incl unfinished','Arrived-only benefit'],[(r['year'],r['seed'],r['solution_id'],mean(r,'waiting_s_departed_including_unfinished'),mean(r,'elapsed_trip_duration_s_departed_including_unfinished'),'SUPPRESSED — censored/unserved') for r in primary if r['year'] in [2026,2040]]),'Means describe departed-cohort exposure up to fixed horizon and include unfinished trips; they are not full requested-cohort journey-time estimates. Time loss/depart-delay/distributions and arrived-only raw durations remain in per-OD result data, with denominator/censoring labels. Lower elapsed time alone is not a benefit when late trips fail or remain unfinished.','## 15. Queue results',table(['Year','Seed','Scenario','Max stopped count','Max lane extent m','Queue lane-seconds'],[(r['year'],r['seed'],r['solution_id'],r['max_stopped_count'],r['max_lane_queue_extent_m'],sum(r['queue_duration_lane_seconds'].values())) for r in primary if r['year'] in [2026,2040]]),'Stopped threshold<0.3m/s; queue count and physical extent are distinct. Extent uses rear-most stopped body tail to furthest front; tails can extend below lane0 and are flagged boundary-censored. Bodies across adjacent edges are not reconstructed; internal/boundary uncertainty persists. Driver queues sampled1s; playback/queue-tail audit5s; occupancy/speed supplement0.5s. Queue lane-seconds sum over occupied queue lanes, not vehicle waiting time. Full-horizon occupancy includes empty samples; original conditional-on-nonempty occupancy is also retained and labelled.','## 16. Spillback results',table(['Year','Seed','Scenario','Verified in model','Unresolved candidates'],[(r['year'],r['seed'],r['solution_id'],r['verified_in_model_spillback'],r['spillback_candidates']) for r in primary]),'M051 causal trace/detector retained. Zero detected episodes means none under the specific detector/model/horizon; it is not proof Gedangan has no real spillback. Congestion/queues are not automatically promoted to verified spillback.','## 17–18. Frontage and feeder impacts; per-OD trade-offs','Delta B−S00, REFERENCE seed42. Same endpoints and requested counts. Negative arrival delta is adverse. Waiting differences are conditional exposure, not a policy benefit.',table(['Year','Scenario','OD','Δrequested','Δarrived','Δfailed','Δrunning','Δwaiting mean s'],[(c['year'],c['solution_id'],od,v['requested'],v['arrived'],v['failed_routes'],v['running'],v['waiting_s_departed_including_unfinished_delta']) for c in comparisons if c['year'] in [2026,2040] and c['seed']==42 and c['growth']=='REFERENCE' and next(r for r in rr if r['run_id']==c['intervention'])['network_variant']=='pilot-provisional' for od,v in c['OD_impacts'].items()]),'Frontage is existing source geography, not newly constructed. User observation of relatively smooth frontage is qualitative, not a target speed. S03 can worsen accessibility or shift queues; these outcomes are retained. Upstream/downstream lane traces, station, Ketajen, junction and corridor OD diagnostics remain available per run.','## 19. Heavy vehicles and class impacts',table(['Year','Seed','Deferred requests','Deferred departed','Deferred arrived','Deferral vehicle-s','Outside demand window','Outside horizon'],[(r['year'],r['seed'],r['deferral']['demand_deferred'],r['deferral']['deferred_departed'],r['deferral']['deferred_arrived'],r['deferral']['deferred_vehicle_seconds'],r['deferral']['displaced_outside_demand_window'],r['deferral']['outside_measurement_horizon']) for r in primary if r['solution_id']=='S04']),table(['Year','Scenario','Vehicle type','Requested','Routable','Departed','Moved','Arrived'],[(r['year'],r['solution_id'],cls,c['requested'],c['routable'],c['departed'],c['moved'],c['arrived']) for r in primary if r['year'] in [2026,2040] and r['seed']==42 and r['solution_id'] in ['S00','S04'] for cls,c in r['class_lifecycle'].items()]),'Oversize remains explicitly unroutable. Heavy vehicles use only inherited model permissions; no local-road diversion to bypass restrictions, no TraCI permission override. Existing trailer/heavy access remains provisional, not clearance/legal/swept-path certification.','## 20. Railway and crossing safety','Crossing logic and railway topology are preserved; actual train FCD/tripinfo, closed windows and controller states are retained. Road-lane occupancy during closed states and road-on-rail are checked at0.5s. Contextual crossing-near-red stopped vehicle-seconds are association only, not incremental causal rail delay. Neither concept eliminates any crossing closure in the executed model.','## 21. Safety diagnostics',f'Observed safety diagnostic check: {"PASS" if safety else "INSPECT FAILURES"}. Full-FCD permission audit covers {sum(a["full_FCD_samples_checked"] for a in audits):,} vehicle samples across {len(audits)} actual runs. Collisions, teleports, sampled illegal permissions, road-on-rail and sampled all-red crossing road occupancy are recorded explicitly. Emergency braking NOT MEASURED: no calibrated threshold. Collision0 does not certify geometry/clearance or real-world safety. Existing very short crossing lanes/geometry-provisional warnings remain.','## 22. Censoring and unserved demand','Every requested vehicle reconciles to failed route + arrived + running-at-end + not-departed. SUMO terminal summary loaded count is reconciled excluding actual train trips; raw driver event count is retained because initial loaded events can occur before polling. Failed routes, unfinished and pending insertions remain visible. Fixed2100s horizon for all pairs; no hidden demand reduction/drain.','## 23. Multi-criteria evaluation',table(['Dimension','Evidence','Treatment'],[(k,v['evidence'],v['value']) for k,v in evaluation['dimensions'].items()]),'## 24. Traffic-only Pareto/trade-offs',table(['Year','Growth','Seed','Family','Traffic-only Pareto candidates'],[(g['year'],g['growth'],g['seed'],g['family'],', '.join(g['traffic_only_pareto_solutions'])) for g in evaluation['groups']]),'Minimize unserved requests, maximum stopped count, maximum lane queue extent and deliberate freight-deferral vehicle-seconds. No weighted sum mixes incompatible units. No overall winner: costs, land, engineering, field safety and community impacts are not quantified. Concepts are excluded from performance ranking.','## 25. Growth-year comparisons','REFERENCE requested2026=240,2030=269,2035=311,2040=360 in the inherited illustrative projection; LOW2040=252 and HIGH2040=500. Growth-year effects use separate labelled demand cohorts and must not be confused with same-year intervention effects. Primary2026/2040 holdout seeds42/43;2030seed42;2035 representative S00/S01seed42.','## 26. Sensitivity and uncertainty','Bounded LOW/HIGH2040 S00/S01seed42 and Strict2026 S00/S01seed42 are actual sensitivity runs, not empirical validation. Seed11 training is separate. These checks do not exhaust15years×growth×seed×families×solutions; unrun combinations remain NOT RUN. Network/source access uncertainty, synthetic driver parameters, OD/growth, railway timetable and censoring limit transfer to real Gedangan.',table(['Year','Growth','Family','Seed','Solution','Requested','Arrived','Running','Not departed','Unserved'],[(r['year'],r['growth_scenario'],r['network_variant'],r['seed'],r['solution_id'],r['requested'],r['arrived'],r['running_at_end'],r['not_departed'],r['unserved_total_at_horizon']) for r in sorted(rr,key=lambda r:(r['growth_scenario'],r['solution_id'])) if r['growth_scenario'] in ['LOW','HIGH'] or r['network_variant']=='pilot-strict']), 'Signal timing selected on2026 training demand can worsen a high-demand holdout. Read any loss of arrivals or growth of pending/unfinished trips as an adverse outcome, not a reason to retune on evaluation seeds. Selection remains frozen; no attempt to force a winning result.', '## 27. Performance',table(['Quantity','Measured value'],[('Actual run wall time range s',f'{min(r["wall_seconds"] for r in rr):.2f}–{max(r["wall_seconds"] for r in rr):.2f}'),('Total actual run wall time s (excluding fresh reproduction)',sum(r['wall_seconds'] for r in rr)),('Max sampled SUMO working set MiB',max(r['sumo_peak_working_set_bytes_sampled'] or 0 for r in rr)/1024**2),('Concurrency',1),('Per-run process budget', '180s inherited bound'),('GPU/VRAM telemetry','NOT MEASURED; headless SUMO and SVG recorded playback')]),'Windows target16GB RAM/AMD GPU6GB is a target, not a certified benchmark. Process CPU seconds and sampled working set are saved per run. Cache manifests validate content before reuse. UI uses bounded five-frame playback pages, no dual live TraCI control.','## 28. Internal browser screenshots',f'M08 browser QA status: {qa.get("status","PENDING")}. See `documentation/m08/m08-browser-qa.json` and screenshot files. Screenshots show actual recorded data or explicit concept-only state.','\n'.join(f'![{p.stem}](m08/{p.name})' for p in sorted(set(DOC.glob('m08-*.jpg')) | set(DOC.glob('resume-*.jpg')))),'## 29. Regression tests',f'Initial old suite:234 tests PASS. Final: {test_match[1]+" tests in "+test_match[2]+"s" if test_match else "PENDING"}; {"PASS" if tests_ok else "PARTIAL"}. Logs: initial-regression.txt, final-regression.txt, typescript.txt, production-build.txt. Meaningful negative guards, actual SUMO mechanisms, full conservation/permission/rail audits, API and concept gates tested.','A post-browser suite exposed an intermittent incomplete-response failure in the local HTTP transport. The failed logs were retained; identity responses could stop after195840 of245099 declared bytes despite a complete server write. SO_LINGER was tested and removed because it did not resolve it. The tested correction is HTTP/1.1 with bounded16KiB chunk framing, plus compact polling and source-scoped request recovery. Both gzip and identity responses passed12 direct/proxy checks. Exact OS/intermediary cause is not claimed. Final regression covers the correction and the added browser-run data. See transport-root-cause.json and transport-chunked-check.json.', '## 30. Reproducibility','```json\n'+json.dumps(repro,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n```','Fresh independent S00 run compares canonical numeric tripinfo/FCD XML, excluding process/path headers. Cache rerun verifies original output manifest unchanged. REBUILD_SOLUTIONS_M08.bat reuses verified caches and executes missing work sequentially; failed scientific setup attempts remain separately visible.','## 31. Source immutability',f'{n} baseline M01–M07 files rehashed unchanged. M08 modules/config/derivatives/results/documentation/viewer/launchers isolated. Original OSM, controls, M07 custom scenarios and reports preserved. Dynamic M07 QA copies are exclusively under M08. No dependencies installed. The three executable hashes are pinned in toolchain-sha256.json and checked by workflow/interactive entrypoints before cache reuse; initial --version logs separately prove actual1.28.0.','## 32. Engineering blockers','Surveyed elevations/ROW/land ownership/buildings/access, utilities, geotechnical/foundations, flood/groundwater/drainage, road/rail clearances, realistic ramp geometry, heavy swept paths, construction staging/emergency/local/pedestrian access and authority approvals missing. S05 additional valid controller missing. Concepts remain visible and blocked.','## 33. Empirical limitations','No calibrated2026 observation counts/OD/speeds/queues/signal/rail timetable. No synthetic number presented as a Gedangan measurement. No rupiah, acquisition area or field benefit invented. M08 advances experiment tooling and transparent conditional comparisons, not validated prediction or construction approval.','## 34. Acceptance criteria one by one',table(['No.','Criterion','Status','Evidence'],[(i,name,'PASS' if ok else 'PARTIAL',e) for i,(name,ok,e) in enumerate(checks,1)]),'## 35. M09 readiness','Software comparison foundation is available subject to the technical status above. Empirical and engineering gaps remain explicit. **M09 NOT STARTED.** Starting it requires a new user instruction.','## Source and evidence index','`documentation/m08/source-register.json`, baseline-sha256.json, toolchain version JSON, EXECUTION_PLAN.md, run-queue.json, robustness-queue.json, offline-stage.json, signal-training.json, comparisons.json, full-FCD-audits.json, supplementary-audits.json, failure-ledger.json, acceptance.json, reproducibility.json and delivery-manifest.json. Canonical actual inputs/logs/XML/traces/recordings are under simulation/runs/m08; derivative manifests/NETCONVERT intermediates under simulation/network/m08.']
